{@linkcode Ende.DirEntry}. The order of entries is not guaranteed.

```ts
for await (const dirEntry of Ende.readDir("/")) {
  console.log(dirEntry.name);
}
```

Throws error if `path` is not a directory.

Requires `allow-read` permission.

